Third-party / bundled model weights (NOT covered by the MIT text above)

Optional installer components under data/models/ ship pretrained weights that
remain under their original licenses. Full texts are also kept next to the
weights (see data/models/LICENSE_*.txt).

  • Salesforce BLIP (image captioning weights under data/models/blip/)
    License: BSD 3-Clause
    Copyright (c) 2022 Salesforce, Inc.
    See: data/models/LICENSE_BLIP.txt
    Upstream: https://huggingface.co/Salesforce/blip-image-captioning-base

  • EasyOCR recognition / detection weights (under data/models/easyocr/,
    including CRAFT detection and recognition checkpoints such as
    craft_mlt_25k.pth and cyrillic_g2.pth)
    License: Apache License 2.0 (EasyOCR / Jaided AI and related components)
    See: data/models/LICENSE_EasyOCR.txt and data/models/NOTICE_EasyOCR.txt
    Upstream: https://github.com/JaidedAI/EasyOCR

Chat / embedding models that you pull yourself (e.g. via Ollama: gemma3, gemma4,
all-minilm, etc.) are not redistributed with this repository; they remain under
their respective upstream licenses.

Third-party Python packages listed in install/requirements.txt are governed by
their own licenses.
